message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
title: "SattvaRoute: Evidence-driven AI-assisted physical design orchestration and approval-gated recovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "SattvaRoute contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAMA-L7/SattvaRoute"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - physical design
  - EDA
  - OpenROAD
  - AI agents
  - failure diagnosis
  - reproducibility
abstract: >
  SattvaRoute is a research prototype for evidence-grounded physical-design
  orchestration. It executes OpenROAD-flow stages with immutable run evidence,
  diagnoses failures using logs and OpenDB state, requires human approval for
  bounded changes, and reports execution and engineering status separately.
